  {
    "type": "npc",
    "id": "BR1_exchange_guard",
    "//": "Exchange guards: one by the gate, two in the back corners of the aisle (NC_BR1_EXCHANGE_GUARD).",
    "class": "NC_BR1_EXCHANGE_GUARD",
    "attitude": 0,
    "mission": "GUARD",
    "chat": "TALK_BR1_EXCHANGE_GUARD",
    "faction": "br1_exchange"
  },
  {
    "type": "talk_topic",
    "id": "TALK_BR1_TRADER",
    "dynamic_line": [
      "Welcome to the Exchange.  Look all you like; touch and you've bought it.",
      "Got almond water?  Then we're friends.  Got anything else, we can still talk.",
      "Prices are fair.  Fair down here, anyway.",
      "Buying, selling, or just enjoying the light?  It's the brightest corner on the level, I'll give you that."
    ],
    "responses": [
      { "text": "Let's trade.", "effect": "start_trade", "topic": "TALK_BR1_TRADER" },
      { "text": "What do you sell?", "topic": "TALK_BR1_TRADER_SELLS" },
      { "text": "What is this place?", "topic": "TALK_BR1_EXCHANGE_ABOUT" },
      { "text": "Heard anything worth knowing?", "topic": "TALK_BR1_EXCHANGE_NEWS" },
      { "text": "Just looking.  Bye.", "topic": "TALK_DONE" }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "talk_topic",
    "id": "TALK_BR1_TRADER_SELLS",
    "//": "Each trader names their trade: what's on the stall, what they buy, and that their own kit isn't for sale.",
    "dynamic_line": {
      "npc_has_class": "NC_BR1_TRADER_SUPPLIES",
      "yes": "Food, water, medicine.  Almond water by the case, beans, granola, crackers, bandages, aspirin, disinfectant, purifying tablets.  Everything on the stall, nothing on me.  I'll buy the same off you, and I pay well for it, but I don't want your scrap.",
      "no": {
        "npc_has_class": "NC_BR1_TRADER_GEAR",
        "yes": "Batteries first, lights second.  Cells, flashlights, glowsticks, lighters, duct tape, rope, and a few real tools when the runners find them.  The stall's for sale; my own kit isn't.  Bring me tools, parts and batteries and I'll pay a quarter over the odds.",
        "no": "Maps, road maps, notes.  Things that tell you where you are, which down here is worth more than food.  And one odd find every few days, whatever turned up.  Bring me books, maps, scraps of paper with writing on: I buy stories.  Everything else, try my neighbours."
      }
    },
    "responses": [ { "text": "Let's trade.", "effect": "start_trade", "topic": "TALK_BR1_TRADER" }, { "text": "Thanks.", "topic": "TALK_BR1_TRADER" } ]
  },
  {
    "type": "talk_topic",
    "id": "TALK_BR1_EXCHANGE_ABOUT",
    "dynamic_line": "The Exchange.  People fall in here with their pockets full and no idea what anything's worth.  We fix that.  You bring what you found, we give you what you need, and nobody gets stabbed over a can of beans.  Almond water's the closest thing to money down here: it never goes off, and everyone needs it.",
    "responses": [ { "text": "Got it.", "topic": "TALK_BR1_TRADER" } ]
  },
  {
    "type": "talk_topic",
    "id": "TALK_BR1_EXCHANGE_NEWS",
    "dynamic_line": [
      "The Breakroom people trade with us when they can spare a runner.  Decent folk.  Bad hagglers.",
      "Somebody swore a stairwell near the far ramps goes down instead of up.  Came back two days later smelling of hot pipes and wouldn't say more.",
      "Lights are dying faster near the old lobbies.  Buy batteries while I've got them.",
      "A squatter tried to pay me in wallpaper last week.  Peeled it off a wall on Level 0, he said.  I took it.  It's still damp.",
      "Hounds have been sniffing round the fence at night.  The guard says it's fine.  The guard says that a lot.",
      "If a lift opens on a dark lobby, don't get out.  That's free advice.  The rest costs."
    ],
    "responses": [ { "text": "Thanks.", "topic": "TALK_BR1_TRADER" } ]
  },
  {
    "type": "talk_topic",
    "id": "TALK_BR1_EXCHANGE_GUARD",
    "dynamic_line": [
      "Weapons stay put away inside the wire.  Trade's that way.",
      "No fights, no theft, no running.  Break one and you're out, and the Hounds can have you.",
      "The gate's open till something tries to come through it."
    ],
    "responses": [ { "text": "Understood.", "topic": "TALK_DONE" } ]
  }
]
